  "body": "Brand New | Three Bedrooms | Internal Garage | $1,395,000\r\n\r\nRoom to spread out, space to entertain and the beach just a short stroll away. Welcome to Lot 6 at COAST Orewa, a brand-new three-bedroom townhouse offering 137sqm of thoughtfully designed living in the heart of this much-loved seaside town.\r\n\r\nSet across two levels, this spacious home strikes a lovely balance between everyday practicality and relaxed coastal living. Downstairs, the open-plan living and dining area flows naturally outdoors to a private entertaining space that enjoys the afternoon sun. It's an inviting spot for summer barbecues, long lunches with friends or simply unwinding at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three generous bedrooms provide flexibility for family, guests or a dedicated home office. With two bathrooms, an additional guest toilet downstairs and a generous single internal-access garage, there's plenty of room for the practical side of life too.\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing without wanting to compromise on space, looking for a modern family home or making a lifestyle move to the coast, Lot 6 offers the freedom to enjoy it all.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Living\r\n*\tThree bedrooms across two levels\r\n*\t137sqm of thoughtfully planned floor area\r\n*\t128sqm freehold landholding\r\n*\tTwo bathrooms plus a guest toilet\r\n*\tSpacious open-plan living and dining downstairs\r\n*\tOutdoor entertaining area enjoying afternoon sunshine\r\n*\tGenerous single garage with internal access\r\n*\tBrand-new, easy-care living in a superb coastal location\r\n\r\nCOAST is an exciting new residential development bringing together a collection of contemporary townhouses and apartments, with one, two and three-bedroom options across single-level and two-level layouts.\r\nFrom compact coastal retreats to more generous family-sized homes, COAST offers a range of homes designed to suit different stages of life.\r\n\r\nThe development also includes four retail premises, bringing another layer of convenience to this well-connected coastal address.\r\nJust 200m from Orewa's town centre and approximately 350m from the beach, COAST puts so much of everyday life within easy walking distance, plus the added bonus of a convenient bus stop right outside the entrance, making getting around even easier.\r\nMorning coffee at your favourite café, a walk along the beach, lunch with friends or an evening out at one of Orewa's many restaurants. Groceries, shops, medical services and everyday essentials are all close by.\r\n\r\nIt's the kind of location that makes life feel a little easier, with everything you need and everything you enjoy right on your doorstep.\r\nConstruction is well underway, with your new home taking shape in the hands of an experienced New Zealand builder, and the added peace of mind of a 10-year building warranty. Completion is anticipated in March 2027, with your new home ready to welcome you shortly after.\r\n\r\nStage 1 has just been released, bringing an exciting opportunity to secure a brand-new home in one of Auckland's most popular coastal communities.\r\n\r\nLot 6 offers something special within the collection: the space of a three-bedroom home, the practicality of an internal-access garage and the convenience of living moments from the beach and town centre.\r\n\r\nOnsite access is currently restricted while construction progresses. Contact Dylan to discuss the home and arrange a viewing appointment as access becomes available shortly.\r\n\r\nVisit coastorewa.com to register your interest, explore the development and receive updates on future releases.\r\nMore space for living. More time for enjoying. Come home to the COAST.\r\n\r\nAsking Price $1,395,000\r\n3 x bed\r\n2.5x bath\r\n1 x garage\r\n137 sqm floor area (more or less)\r\nLand 128 sqm (more or less)\r\n\r\n* Renders are artist impression. Note the floorplan kitchen layout is different to the render.  Floor plan is correct kitchen layout.",
